  "content": "<!--$-->\n<!--/$-->\n<!--$-->\n<!--/$-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <a data-testid=\"geistcn/skip-nav-link\" class=\"fixed -m-px overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap border-0 top-16 left-12 z-[1000] flex items-center outline-none text-[var(--geist-link-color)] px-1 py-0 bg-[var(--geist-background)] shadow-[0_0_0_2px_var(--geist-background),0_0_0_4px_var(--geist-link-color)] rounded-[var(--geist-radius)] opacity-0 pointer-events-none focus:opacity-100 focus:[pointer-events:_all]\" href=\"#geist-skip-nav\" tabindex=\"0\">Skip to content</a>\n  <div class=\"flex min-w-0\">\n   <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n    <div class=\"stack-module__BwJUkq__stack stack geist-soft-reset lg:first:pt-[calc(var(--banner-min-height))] stack-module__BwJUkq__padding\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--stack-flex:initial;--stack-direction:column;--stack-align:stretch;--stack-justify:flex-start;--sm-stack-padding:16px 0px;--md-stack-padding:32px 0px;--lg-stack-padding:90px 0px;--xl-stack-padding:90px 0px;--stack-gap:0px\">\n     <div class=\"max-w-(--ds-page-width-with-margin) px-(--geist-page-margin) mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"gap-x-6 gap-y-6\">\n       <div class=\"[--article-full-width:calc(100%+2*var(--article-padding))] [--article-max-width:100%] [--article-padding:24px] [--grid-divider-gap:72px] [--guide-color:var(--ds-gray-200)]\">\n        <article>\n         <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n          <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Teams building on <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/platforms\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/platforms\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">Vercel for Platforms</a> can now create deployments directly from their users' GitHub repositories, without requiring them to install the Vercel GitHub App. When <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/rest-api/reference/endpoints/deployments/create-a-new-deployment\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/rest-api/reference/endpoints/deployments/create-a-new-deployment\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">creating a deployment</a>, pass a <code>gitAccessToken</code> alongside <!-- --><code>gitSource</code>. Vercel uses the token to retrieve the source and build the deployment.<!-- --></p>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Tokens should be read-only, scoped to the requested repository, and valid for 24 hours or less. Vercel temporarily stores the token in encrypted form so source retrieval can complete. The token is never stored on the deployment.</p>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Learn more about <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/rest-api/deployments/create-a-new-deployment#gitAccessToken\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/rest-api/deployments/create-a-new-deployment#gitAccessToken\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">using a GitHub access token</a>.</p>\n          </div>\n          <section class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) flex flex-col gap-4 mt-6\">\n           <h2 class=\"text-label-14 font-medium\">Contributors</h2>\n           <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-900\">\n            <p class=\"text-copy-14 text-pretty\"><a href=\"https://github.com/kevinsundstrom\" rel=\"author\" target=\"_blank\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 hover:underline\">Kevin Sundstrom</a></p>\n           </div>\n          </section>\n         </div>\n        </article>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <section class=\"items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-8 pt-8\" data-cdp-scope=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;pre_footer&quot;}\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-balance text-gray-1000 [--font-weight-semibold:450] text-heading-64 tracking-tighter col-span-full\">Ready to deploy?</h2>\n       <div class=\"col-span-full flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n        <a role=\"link\" href=\"https://vercel.com/new\" type=\"submit\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" data-cdp-track=\"{&quot;event&quot;:&quot;pre_footer_cta_clicked&quot;}\" data-zone=\"2d9dc9\" class=\"outline-none m-0 p-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium !px-(--geist-gap-half) max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:transition-none data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] aria-disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] disabled:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] [--x-padding:10px] [--height:var(--ds-size-medium)] text-[14px] !rounded-full h-[var(--height)] data-hover:bg-[var(--themed-hover-bg,_hsl(0,_0%,_22%))] dark-theme:data-hover:bg-[var(--themed-hover-bg,_hsl(0,_0%,_80%))] data-hover:[--themed-border:var(--themed-hover-bg,_var(--ds-gray-200))] data-hover:disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)]\" data-geist-button=\"\" data-prefix=\"false\" data-suffix=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--geist-icon-size:16px\"><span class=\"truncate inline-block px-1.5\">Start deploying</span></a><a role=\"link\" type=\"submit\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" data-cdp-track=\"{&quot;event&quot;:&quot;pre_footer_cta_clicked&quot;}\" data-zone=\"same\" class=\"outline-none m-0 p-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium !px-(--geist-gap-half) max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] aria-disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] disabled:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] [--x-padding:10px] [--height:var(--ds-size-medium)] text-[14px] !rounded-full [--themed-bg:_var(--ds-background-100)] shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--themed-border,_transparent)] [--themed-hover-bg:_var(--ds-gray-alpha-200)] [--themed-fg:_var(--ds-gray-1000)] [--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] data-[focus]:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--themed-border,_transparent),0_0_0_2px_var(--ds-background-100),0_0_0_4px_var(--ds-focus-color)] data-[focus]:transition-none h-[var(--height)] data-hover:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] dark-theme:data-hover:bg-[var(--ds-gray-200)] data-hover:text-[var(--themed-fg)] data-hover:disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)]\" data-geist-button=\"\" data-prefix=\"false\" data-suffix=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--geist-icon-size:16px\" href=\"https://vercel.com/contact/sales\"><span class=\"truncate inline-block px-1.5\">Talk to an expert</span></a>\n       </div>\n      </section>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <!--$-->\n    <!--/$-->\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel for Platforms 现允许开发者使用 gitAccessToken 直接从用户的 GitHub 仓库创建部署，无需安装 Vercel GitHub App。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel for Platforms 现允许开发者使用 gitAccessToken 直接从用户的 GitHub 仓库创建部署，无需安装 Vercel GitHub App。",
  "summary": "Vercel 更新日志宣布 Vercel for Platforms 的新功能：通过 REST API 创建部署时，开发者可在 gitSource 之外传递 gitAccessToken。Vercel 使用这个短期、只读的令牌（有效期不超过 24 小时，仅限目标仓库读取权限）拉取源码并构建部署，且不会将令牌存储在部署中。该功能移除了最终用户安装 Vercel GitHub App 的前置条件，简化了集成 Vercel 的平台的部署流程。文章包含相关 API 文档链接，并提供开始使用或联系销售的入口。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "可通过 gitAccessToken 从用户的 GitHub 仓库触发部署。",
      "explanation": "调用部署 API 时提供 gitAccessToken，即可让 Vercel 拉取源码并构建部署，无需安装 Vercel GitHub App。"
    },
    {
      "point": "令牌必须是短期、只读且限定仓库范围的。",
      "explanation": "Vercel 要求令牌有效期不超过 24 小时、仅限特定仓库的读取权限，且仅以加密形式临时存储。"
    },
    {
      "point": "这简化了使用 Vercel for Platforms 的平台的集成工作。",
      "explanation": "平台无需再引导最终用户安装 Vercel GitHub App，降低了部署流程的摩擦。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "基于 Vercel for Platforms 构建的团队现在可以直接从用户的 GitHub 仓库创建部署，无需要求用户安装 Vercel GitHub App。"
  ],
